{"product_id":"the-body-book","title":"The Body Book","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"195\"\u003eA guide to loving your amazing body—from the inside out.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"197\" data-end=\"495\"\u003eIn \u003cem data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"215\"\u003eThe Body Book\u003c\/em\u003e, actress and wellness advocate Cameron Diaz shares her personal journey to better health and a deeper understanding of the body. Blending science-backed information with personal insight, she offers practical advice on nutrition, exercise, sleep, mental health, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"497\" data-end=\"661\"\u003eThis empowering and accessible guide helps women make informed decisions about their well-being—encouraging confidence, self-respect, and lasting lifestyle changes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"839\"\u003eWhether you're just starting your wellness journey or looking for motivation to stay on track, \u003cem data-start=\"758\" data-end=\"773\"\u003eThe Body Book\u003c\/em\u003e is an inspiring companion for building a stronger, healthier you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"841\" data-end=\"940\"\u003eAuthor: Cameron Diaz\u003cbr data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"868\"\u003eISBN: 9780062252740\u003cbr data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"894\"\u003eFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"918\"\u003ePages: Approx. 400\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45621223784601,"sku":"1RG9780062252740","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/81smc0CcqQL.jpg?v=1754484017","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-body-book","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}